crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d1ad169b2a0e9e6aec9fe5e8126c6f4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e0f31b1/uploads/origins/016c666f-d31f-4ace-acd4-11217308ffcb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9fb1fa40a1b413cba6612239d201320 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんばんは、パウチ猫と申します。\n女の子らしい服装の猫使アルさんをお願いします。\n普段アルちゃんは中性的な服装のため、今回女の子っぽい服装を着せられて、表情は恥ずかしがってる感じでお願いします。\n服装やポーズなどはお任せします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kusaikire_iki/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/857f9946/uploads/origins/57604e0d-f377-44c2-bd06-be93649be814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cde34afcb4f0630324c46dd6936292b1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/857f9946/uploads/origins/57604e0d-f377-44c2-bd06-be93649be814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cde34afcb4f0630324c46dd6936292b1, https://si.imgix.net/857f9946/uploads/origins/57604e0d-f377-44c2-bd06-be93649be814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3538c43ed156367e4b51cbe4c1aac4a8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/857f9946/uploads/origins/57604e0d-f377-44c2-bd06-be93649be814?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb0c4d8e59155a11db19f8516336e02a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんばんは、hon_allinと申します。\n諸々お任せでさとうささらさんをお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kusaikire_iki/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5a77e843/uploads/origins/da9a7be5-e262-4345-8021-1bbbbd15aa89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8513990bc51f20f47d544a1a8dc18fb3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5a77e843/uploads/origins/da9a7be5-e262-4345-8021-1bbbbd15aa89?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8513990bc51f20f47d544a1a8dc18fb3, https://si.imgix.net/5a77e843/uploads/origins/da9a7be5-e262-4345-8021-1bbbbd15aa89?bg=%23fff&auto=for